{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"Roy shakes his head with a chuckle at the dramatics. \"Thank you. You see, given I'm now a mender following our new Warden of Waters, I thought of an idea for how I could use my skills for the whole place and everyone in it.\"\n\"That idea being, I want to set up pumps on the Hampstead and Manhattan side. Not to drain the river or anything, just to put it through some filters to get rid of all the muck that got there from redcoats' operations upstream.\"\n\"I talked with Demetrius who said on the Ferrytown side it shouldn't be needed, because of the magic there, I talked with people on the other side of the river who would be willing to help, but it would be disrespectful if I wouldn't also talk with you, as you live in the river itself. Would you have any problem with that idea?\"","created_at":"2021-08-27T08:00:02.516000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880723319916220416","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
